{"id":"primera","lemma":"primera","pos":"noun","rank":215,"glosses":["first gear (lowest gear in a motor vehicle)","first class"],"ipa":"/pɾiˈmeɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"primeras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-primera.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es nuestra primera clase.","en":"It's our first class.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741016"},{"text":"Su biblioteca tiene 3.500 libros e incluye muchas primeras ediciones.","en":"Her library has 3,500 books and includes many first editions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692650"},{"text":"Es nuestra primera lección.","en":"It's our first lesson.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741017"},{"text":"Somos las primeras en llegar.","en":"We're the first to arrive."},{"text":"No serás la primera.","en":"You won't be the first.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460200"}]}